@startuml autonomous-product-service-boundary
title Autonomous Product / Autonomous Service Boundary ; per ADR-ES-017 §11

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Product" as P
class "Autonomous Product" as AP
class "Service" as S
class "Autonomous Service" as AutoS

P <|-- AP : specializes

AP --> S : may be delivered-through
S <|-- AutoS : specializes

note right
  Per ADR-ES-017 §11 + APROD-AUTO-NEG-002:
  - An Autonomous Service does NOT automatically make the Product Autonomous
  - An Autonomous Product may be delivered through conventional or autonomous services
end note

@enduml
